_:c14n226 sh:datatype xsd:string ;
	sh:description "Opaque external / instance-identity strings for a structural node — Product, ProductInstance, or Component (§1). This is ADR-0002's per-type instance identity (\"software = a build/commit/hash/SBOM; hardware = firmware + buses + cores (HBOM)\") and the generic↔instance half of DEC-009, which the §13 classes otherwise could not carry: `catalog_ref` names a GENERIC catalog entry (CWE/CVE/CAPEC), not the concrete artifact. Scheme-prefixed and OPAQUE, like `catalog_ref` / `external_refs` — a CPE, a package URL (purl), a SWID/SBOM ref, a build/commit hash, or a firmware-image digest. The scheme is NOT pinned and no CPE/SBOM schema is imported (ADR-0004 substrate-neutrality). Additive DRAFT slot (DEC-001 open); not a new §13 class." ;
	sh:nodeKind sh:Literal ;
	sh:order 4 ;
	sh:path tmodel:identifiers .
